{
 "_note": "设置页的额度探针。/rate_limit 本身**不计入配额**(GitHub 明示),可以随时查。\nv41 起全包只用 GraphQL,所以看的是 `resources.graphql`(5000 点/小时),不再是 core。\n【G23 豁免】看的就是「此刻还剩多少」,缓存与目的相悖。",
 "version": 1,
 "actions": [
  {
   "id": "cred",
   "action": "credential.state",
   "params": {
    "id": "gh"
   },
   "_note": "凭证绑定状态(纯本地查表,零网络)。v41 起 gh 是 required:未绑时宿主不注入、请求必 401,页面据 hasToken / credState 画绑定引导。"
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "hdr",
    "value": {
     "Accept": "application/vnd.github+json",
     "User-Agent": "Numable"
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "resp",
   "action": "request",
   "params": {
    "url": "https://api.github.com/rate_limit",
    "method": "GET",
    "header": "${hdr}",
    "formatType": "json",
    "credential": "gh"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "limit",
    "value": "${resp.resources.graphql.limit}"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "remaining",
    "value": "${resp.resources.graphql.remaining}"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "resetAt",
    "value": "$[formatDate::(calc::(${resp.resources.graphql.reset}*1000),HH:mm)]"
   }
  },
  {
   "_note": "只回「配没配」,绝不回 token 本体 —— 页面拿到就可能进 DOM、进日志、进分享截图。\n  ⚠️ 2026-09-09 由 `eq::(${resp.rate.limit},60)` 迁到 `credential.state`。\n  旧写法是**从配额上限反推**有没有 token(匿名恒 60/h、认证 5000/h)—— 能用,但它是\n  **纯服务特定的 hack**:GitHub 哪天调一下匿名配额,这个判据就静默失真(不报错,\n  只是徽标一直显示反的)。而且它要等 /rate_limit 回来才知道,断网时答不出。\n  现在直接查绑定表:纯本地、零网络、与服务方配额策略解耦。",
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "hasToken",
    "value": "$[if::(eq::(${cred.state},bound),1,0)]"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "credState",
    "value": "$[connect::(${cred.state},)]"
   }
  },
  {
   "action": "resultFilter",
   "params": {
    "keys": [
     "limit",
     "remaining",
     "resetAt",
     "hasToken",
     "credState"
    ]
   }
  }
 ],
 "_lintCache": "exempt"
}
